      "ar:decisionRationale": "Separate evidence generation from promotion; current v0.2 is contested, but definition revision should be a distinct decision event after the null-test record exists.",
      "ar:reversible": true,
      "ar:reversalCondition": "Review and promote a v0.3 field definition in a subsequent explicit decision."
    },
    {
